{'symbol': 'DGX', 'date': '2022-08-17 07:30:00', 'title': 'QUEST DIAGNOSTICS AIMS TO CLOSE GAPS IN MATERNAL HEALTHCARE WITH NEW OBSTETRICS TEST PANEL THAT INCLUDES HEPATITIS C SCREENING', 'text': "NEW TEST PANEL FOLLOWS A QUEST DIAGNOSTICS HEALTH TRENDS® STUDY WITH THE CDC THAT REVEALED LESS THAN HALF OF PREGNANT PEOPLE ARE SCREENED FOR HEPATITIS C AS RECOMMENDED UNDER GUIDELINES SECAUCUS, N.J. , AUG. 17, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- QUEST DIAGNOSTICS (NYSE: DGX), THE WORLD'S LEADING PROVIDER OF DIAGNOSTIC INFORMATION SERVICES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF A NEW OBSTETRICS LABORATORY TEST PANEL DESIGNED TO ENABLE PHYSICIANS TO SCREEN ALL ELIGIBLE PREGNANT PEOPLE EASILY AND RELIABLY FOR HEPATITIS C (HCV) WITH OTHER LABORATORY TESTS TYPICALLY ORDERED DURING EARLY PREGNANCY."}